Use sp/spacing from uikit for padding instead of hardcoded px? The traps say never hard-code pixel values for spacing — use `sp({p: 4})` className or Box spacing. I'll use `Box spacing={{p: 6}}` and a max-width container via inline style maxWidth (maxWidth isn't a spacing concern; fine as px value in style? The rule concerns padding/margin specifically. maxWidth: 1100 is fine as inline style).

